## 4b. Screener engine (fundamental universe) - added 2026-10-09
Location: `Blue_engine/screener/`. Read-only against screener.in. **No order path.**
Screens the Indian universe on fundamentals before Alpha scores it:
```
1. market cap  >  200 Cr
2. debt/equity <  1     (banks/NBFCs/insurers excluded - D/E is not solvency for a lender)
```
```powershell
# screen an explicit list (the only source that can derive debt/equity)
python -m blue_engine.screener.screener_engine --symbols RELIANCE,TCS,INFY
# sweep a sector and save for the Dashboard Screener page (/screener)
python -m blue_engine.screener.screener_engine --source sector --sectors IN02 --save
```
- Vendored like OpenAlgo: `screener/vendor/screener-india/` is a **pristine upstream clone**
  (gitignored, never hand-edited). The Python port in `screener/client/` is what runs;
  Node.js is NOT installed and NOT needed. Check drift with
  `python Blue_engine\screener\_vendor_pin.py --check`.
- Extra deps (already installed): `beautifulsoup4`, `lxml`. Declared in the
  `screener` extra of `Blue_engine/pyproject.toml`.
